{"timestamp":"2026-10-02T08:23:24.857Z","ordinal":12,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0fe522b562b81a19016abf69fa487c87d2982e4fc4eeac7a47","status":"completed","call_id":"call_TUVrvvMOQK79SiwdCTV3RUXg","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat /private/tmp/clarify-task4-documents-20261002/case06/view-a/guide.md\",login:false,max_output_tokens:10000});text(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0fbb5-e175-76b1-b683-3d34bd2a75ea","create_time":1790929398.414105}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-02T08:23:25.510Z","ordinal":15,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a0fbb6-0646-7bf2-a91a-83347bf26825","call_id":"call_TUVrvvMOQK79SiwdCTV3RUXg","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.6 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"# Preparation defaults\nRestaurant owners can set one preparation time and override it for individual\nitems. This increment adds lookup and a snapshot: each new order stores the resolved\nminutes so later default changes cannot change it.\n\nWith a restaurant default of 15 minutes, an item with a missing or null prep_minutes\ninherits 15; an explicit zero stays 0. If the default becomes 20, the inherited\nitem's next lookup returns 20, the zero item stays 0, and an earlier order keeps 15.\n\nThe storage field is prep_minutes. effective_minutes resolves the current value;\ncreate_order copies it into a new order. Scheduling is outside this increment.\nThe product owner still needs to decide inheritance badges for the menu editor.\n\n## Reference\nThe maximum accepted default is 60 minutes.\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0fbb5-e175-76b1-b683-3d34bd2a75ea","create_time":1790929405.510631}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-02T08:23:36.259Z","ordinal":20,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","id":"msg_0fe522b562b81a19016abf6a03751c87d2b56f17785ae9d893","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"1. Let restaurant owners set a default preparation time with item overrides, while preserving each order’s original resolved time.\n2. With a 15-minute default, missing or null `prep_minutes` inherits 15; explicit zero stays 0. Changing the default to 20 affects future lookups, while an earlier order keeps 15.\n3. This increment adds current-value lookup through `effective_minutes` and a snapshot copied into each new order by `create_order`.\n4. Scheduling remains outside this increment.\n5. The product owner must decide inheritance badges for the menu editor."}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0fbb5-e175-76b1-b683-3d34bd2a75ea","create_time":1790929407.077643,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0fe522b562b81a19016abf6a03751c87d2b56f17785ae9d893","turn_id":"01a0fbb5-e175-76b1-b683-3d34bd2a75ea","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a0fbb6-3043-72e0-abe3-81401b5c520d","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":2}}
